          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.10.1+1CH.10.2+1CH.10.3+1CH.10.4+1CH.10.5+1CH.10.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kigana 10:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jayac no odwoko ni, “Onwaŋere ni oyido anitie wi got Gilbowa, Saulo oyido othenere kwoŋ toŋ pere, aka cawila gi jolweny oyido jobino yu bongi go gi kayina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go wire, onenan, aka olwoŋan; t'adwoko ni, ‘Jadwoŋ’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo openjan ŋat'abedo, t'awaco rigo ni oyido abedo Jaamalek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go owaco ran ni, ‘Biye nekan! Rupiri aditi g'adhola kwoŋan, aka acegin tho.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno akidho bongi go, aka aneko go, rupiri oyido aŋeyo ni go k'okwo k'opodhi piny. Aka akwanyo sangaria pere gi atego pere wok i cinge, aka akelo rin jo jadwoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oyeco woko law pere i rem, aka cwo pere bende jotimo ameno ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jobedo gi geregere aka joywak to joriyo tundo othieno ri Saulo gi wode Yonathan kodi ri ji pa Rwoth rupiri kweth m'oyido oneki i lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo jayac m'okelo rigo wac ni, “Iwok kune?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jayac no odwoko ni, “Abedo japath, Jaamalek, t'abedo i piny perin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi openjo go ni, “Raŋo lworo k'omakin neko ŋata Rwoth owiro gi mo bedo kere?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Daudi olwoŋo acel kwoŋ cwo pere, aka owaco rigo ni, “Neki go!” Aka jalo ocwowo Jaamalek to wumiya go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owaco ri Jaamalek ni, “In won ikelo gime kwoŋin; rupiri dhokin won ama osegeya in munyo iwaco ni, ‘Aneko ŋata Rwoth owiro gi mo bedo kere.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ywako Saulo gi Yonathan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owero ywak ajore ri Saulo gi Yonathan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.10.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 10:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka owodho or ni wofonji ji ma Yuda; aka ondikere i kitawo ma Jasar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kitawo ma Jasar",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kitawo pa jom'otire",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wer no kadho ama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
